adaptation-samsung-beyond2lte (5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Sound: the Samsung audio HAL is 32-bit only, so the 64-bit pulseaudio
    loaded the AOSP stub audio.primary.default (silence in, nothing out).
    Keep the vendor HIDL audio service enabled (droid-system-overlay
    init.disabled.rc) and bind audio.hidl_compat over the stub at
    android-mount, only when ABOX got calliope_sram.bin at boot (needs the
    boot image with the firmware in the initramfs; otherwise the stub stays).

 -- Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>  Fri, 02 Oct 2026 21:30:00 +0200

adaptation-samsung-beyond2lte (4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Screen blank inhibition from applications: blokada-wygaszania owns
    org.freedesktop.ScreenSaver (Firefox, Chromium, KDE apps), forwards each
    inhibition to powerdevil and follows its ChangeScreenSettings inhibitions
    (portal Inhibit); the state goes to wayfire through the new podglad IPC
    methods idle-inhibit and idle-activity.

 -- Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>  Fri, 02 Oct 2026 19:30:00 +0200

